description: >
  QA log for src/index.ts and src/types/index.ts against src/.aide — two unregistered tools (aide_info, aide_inspect) absent from the spec's tool-surface enumeration, same spec-gap class as the prior closed issue.
intent: >
  src/.aide outcomes.desired[0] enumerates six lifecycle tools (discover, read,
  scaffold, validate, init, upgrade). The server registers eight: the six plus
  aide_info and aide_inspect. Neither of the additional tools is named in the spec,
  and no outcome justifies their presence or shows the responsibility could not be
  absorbed by an existing tool. The spec also warns explicitly against adding tools
  whose responsibility "didn't quite fit" an existing tool.
misalignment:
